OL,3,GNEWSACall to ease 'burden' of housing
OL,4,Arefugees on Glasgow City Council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe frontrunner to be the next leader
OL,7,Fof Glasgow City Council has said it is
OL,8,Funfair Glasgow council tax payers are
OL,9,F"carrying the burden" of housing
OL,10,Frefugees for the "whole of Scotland".
OL,12,FRicky Bell, currently deputy leader,
OL,13,Fsaid the council needed more funding or
OL,14,Fa change in the law that would see more
OL,15,Fpeople housed outside of the city.
OL,17,FAlmost half of the 3,895 homelessness
OL,18,Fapplications in Glasgow between April
OL,19,Fand September 2025 were from people
OL,20,Fwith refugee status or leave to remain.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
