OL,3,GNEWSACall to ease 'burden' of housing
OL,4,Arefugees on Glasgow City Council
OL,5,
OL,6,FBell told BBC Radio Scotland Breakfast:
OL,7,F"The government either needs to change
OL,8,Fthe legislation or fund the outcomes of
OL,9,Fthat legislation, and at the moment
OL,10,Fwe're in the middle of that and they're
OL,11,Fdoing neither."
